Str_Press_OK_to_complete_TRACK_CLEAR:	.asciz "Press OK to complete TRACK CLEAR."
Str_Dr_cken_Sie_OK_um_TRACK_CLEAR_auszuf_hre:	.asciz "Dr\xFCcken Sie OK um TRACK CLEAR auszuf\xFChren. "
